#*: He [''[[sc.]]'' [[w:James Moriarty|James Moriarty]]] is the [[napoleon|Napoleon]] of crime, [[w:John Watson|Watson]]. He is the organizer of half that is evil and of nearly all that is undetected in this great city [''[[sc.]]'' [[London]]]. He is a genius, a philosopher, an abstract thinker.
